{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/821102-bane-clan-ventrue","id":821102,"title":"Bane: Clan Ventrue","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-01T11:45:57-08:00","id":821102,"title":"Bane: Clan Ventrue","content":"Hi guys! I have a doubt concerning Ventrue's Bane. On sourcebook, page 103, you can read that:<br /> <br /> &quot; When creating a Ventrue, apply his first Touchstone to his seventh dot of Humanity. This means his first Humanity loss will also detach that Touchstone as the bane takes effect. Further Touchstones may fill his sixth through second dots.&quot;<br /> <br /> Does this mean a Ventrue no longer has a Bane once he first loses his seventh dot of Humanity? Isn't it a Bane that's easy to overcome because you can simply buy one dot of Touchstone and have a new one attached to your Humanity 6? All other clans have really strong and persistent banes, which stay for you the entire game once you first get to Humanity 6. Ventrue's the opposite. When I read Ventrue's bane, I think it's too easy for them. I see as if they have an advantage which is easy to lose or reinforce/replace, and which does not hinder you once you get to Humanity 6, because he &quot;loses the bane&quot; once he loses the seventh dot.<br /> <br /> Did I misread something or did not pay attention to some detail? Is this it? <br /> What do you think about it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11079-bardobobs","name":"bardobobs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11079_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-01T11:52:56-08:00","id":821106,"title":"","content":"I think this bane looks less punishing purely mechanically. If you think of the in game effort required to justify purchasing that one dot, I mean you have develop a genuine relationship with somebody, not easy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3326-an-fhuiseog","name":"An Fhuiseog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3326_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-01T11:55:29-08:00","id":821108,"title":"","content":"This topic has been extensively discussed several times already. Feel free to take a look at one of these threads for thoughts on the topic, and houserules/alternatives:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/292856-ventrue-clan-bane\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/292856-ventrue-clan-bane\"> Ventrue Clan Bane? - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/292856-ventrue-clan-bane\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/292856-ventrue-clan-bane </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> So the Ventrue Clan Bane is that they lose their first Touchstone at loosing Humanity 7 while the rest of the Clans lose theirs at 6, and the Ventrue are able to normally buy extra Touchstones for their 6-2 dots of humanity. Aren't they getting a kinda get out of jail free card here? Daeva get addicted to </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/56675-the-ventrue-clan-bane-is-a-joke\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/56675-the-ventrue-clan-bane-is-a-joke\"> The Ventrue Clan Bane is a joke... - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/56675-the-ventrue-clan-bane-is-a-joke\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/56675-the-ventrue-clan-bane-is-a-joke </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> ...unless it is intended to demonstrate they are really superior over other clans. I mean, look at the Mekhet, what a heavy burden that gets worse as the vampire succumbs to the Beast... </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/31974-the-aloof-curse-ventrue-bane-question\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/31974-the-aloof-curse-ventrue-bane-question\"> The Aloof Curse (Ventrue Bane Question) - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/31974-the-aloof-curse-ventrue-bane-question\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/31974-the-aloof-curse-ventrue-bane-question </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Hey all, I had questions concerning the Ventrue clan bane. I'm not quite getting it. I've seen the preview before, but I assumed it would make a bit more sense when the book came out. It...sort of does, but I feel as though I'm missing something. I understand some of the implications: buying the Touchstone </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/46160-input-requested-ideas-for-alternate-ventrue-clan-bane\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/46160-input-requested-ideas-for-alternate-ventrue-clan-bane\"> [ Input Requested] Ideas for alternate ventrue clan bane - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/46160-input-requested-ideas-for-alternate-ventrue-clan-bane\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/46160-input-requested-ideas-for-alternate-ventrue-clan-bane </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Hello everyone, I am stuck and would like to ask for some help. I want to (finally) start a gain group again for V:tR. I am using most of the rules from \"Blood &amp; Smoke\", but removed \"Humanity\" infavour of something based on \"Atrocity\" [from V:tR \"Danse Macabre\"]. Instead of losing Humanity, the characters </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/140715-rules-doubts-and-thoughts-about-clan-curses\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/140715-rules-doubts-and-thoughts-about-clan-curses\"> [Rules] Doubts and thoughts about Clan Curses - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/140715-rules-doubts-and-thoughts-about-clan-curses\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/140715-rules-doubts-and-thoughts-about-clan-curses </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Hi all! After some time of getting the right feeling about the new rules of Blood and Smoke, I'm starting a new Chronicle, and when i hit the Curses, i felt the desire of speaking about them a little, specifically about the Nosferatu and Ventrue Curses. Let's give them all a look, one by one, and i'll try </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-01T12:08:23-08:00","id":821122,"title":"","content":"It took me a while to grok it, but I have the unpopular opinion that the Ventrue bane is the secret MVP of the clan curses. That said, it does tend to work best if you really buy into the Touchstone subsystem. If players aren't as interested in that mode of play, it can be less interesting.<br /> <br /> But yeah, those other threads go over it pretty thoroughly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-01T12:15:10-08:00","id":821123,"title":"","content":"I see...<br /> Thanks a lot guys!<br /> Sorry for the reposting","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11079-bardobobs","name":"bardobobs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11079_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-01T12:54:02-08:00","id":821146,"title":"","content":"Yeah, everybody else has provided very illuminating answers. Just my two sense, but I think the key to making a Ventrue who compellingly interacts with their curse is to look at the flavor text of it. Once you drop to Humanity 6, recognize that your Touchstone is still important to your character, but they're not keeping you from degenerating. Ventrue are detached from the most important people in their life. How does that affect their interactions with less important people? If you only visit the woman you were supposed to have loved in life out of a sense of obligation and weird attachment, how do you feel about Joe your former neighbor, who you could tell to jump off a roof with a stern glance and a burst of power? It's actually really scary, because the Ventrue curse has so much hidden implication for them as people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}